<%# An adventurer's portrait (src/range/avatar.ts): the chosen hero's face in a gold-rimmed medallion of their banner colour; xl shows the whole hero. Locals: a (the avatar), optional size ('sm', 'md', 'lg', 'xl'). Decorative: the name sits next to it. Every value goes through the escaped output tag. Never put an EJS tag inside an EJS comment: it breaks parsing. %>
<% var avSize = typeof size !== 'undefined' && size ? size : 'md'; -%>
<span class="avatar av-<%= avSize %>" data-hero="<%= a.hero %>" data-color="<%= a.color %>" aria-hidden="true"><% if (avSize === 'xl') { %><img class="av-full" src="/static/art/heroes/<%= a.hero %>.webp" alt="" decoding="async"><% } else { %><img class="av-face" src="/static/art/heroes/<%= a.hero %>-face.webp" alt="" width="256" height="256" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><% } %></span>
